OL,3,GNEWSAScotRail app problems may not be
OL,4,Afixed by end of the year, MSPs hear
OL,5,
OL,6,FOngoing problems with ScotRail's new
OL,7,Fapp may not be fixed by the end of the
OL,8,Fyear.
OL,10,FAbout 3,000 complaints were made about
OL,11,Fthe mobile system in its first 10 days
OL,12,Fof operation, with users experiencing a
OL,13,Fseries of "glitches" that left them
OL,14,Flocked out of their accounts.
OL,16,FScotRail's managing director Joanne
OL,17,FMaguire told MSPs the company behind
OL,18,Fthe app, SilverRail Technologies, made
OL,19,Foperating system changes "at short
OL,20,Fnotice" before it went live.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
