OL,3,GNEWSAScotRail app problems may not be
OL,4,Afixed by end of the year, MSPs hear
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaguire said ScotRail was in daily
OL,7,Fcontact with the firm, but declined to
OL,8,Fsay whether they would be rectified
OL,9,Fbefore the end of the year.
